WEBVTT

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:03.440
All right, let's have lunch.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.930
Chizuru-kun, you seem happy.

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:07.030
Of course I am.

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:09.760
Now that the proficiency test 
is over, I'm officially free!

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.830
Yay! It's over!

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:13.400
Huh? Where's Yukki?

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.490
There he is.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.130
Yukki, let's eat.

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:18.300
Chizuru, your blazer's in your food.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.520
Huh? No way!

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:20.220
Just kidding.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.060
Oh, come on. I got the curry udon today...

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:26.000
Don't joke like that.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.990
Hey, you'd better not get 
any soup on me, monkey.

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:32.340
I can't promise that.

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.920
You must be doing well if you're 
eating school lunches again.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.430
Have you got 30 sticker points yet?

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:41.520
No, not yet.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.490
I've already exchanged my stickers for a plate.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:45.370
I see.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.550
How many points do you have now?

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:49.780
Seventeen points.

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:51.570
That number hasn't changed in a while.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:53.940
I'm stuck in a rut.

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:56.130
I'm sick of sticker duty!

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:57.780
No more! No more, I say!

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:00.690
We abolished our sticker duty rotation.

00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:03.290
There you go again. "Sticker duty."

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.560
You've mentioned it before, 
but what is it exactly?

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:07.170
Well, it's...

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:09.040
Asaba?

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:11.250
It is you, isn't it? From Class 4?

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:14.490
This is great. You're really tall now.

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:16.700
It'd be better if you had shorter hair, though.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:17.980
Excuse me...

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:20.430
Let's take a look at those muscles.

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:26.900
Oh, sorry. I guess you don't know who I am.

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:29.980
I'm Yanagi from Class 7. Nice to meet you.

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:32.280
My hands are occupied right now.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:35.190
Didn't you just wave him away though?

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:38.000
Asaba, do you have any 
interest in basketball?

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:04.290
My brother, whose sole interest is manga,

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:06.450
has taken a surprising interest in...

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:09.790
the curly-haired Cinderella of the cafeteria.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:16.300
Since then, his "same old, same old" days 
had started becoming more eventful.

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.680
What? The basketball team 
tried to recruit you?

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:22.530
That's amazing. They headhunted you?

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:25.530
They said that they're not as strong 
since the third years left.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:28.020
Naturally, I turned 
him down on the spot.

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:29.760
But, why you?

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:32.750
Yuki's played a game with 
the Basketball Club before.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:33.910
Maybe that's why.

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:36.610
When did you play, Yukki?

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:39.650
When he was trying to
 find a club last spring.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:42.950
Yuki-kun was pretty amazing at it.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:46.100
You jerk! What time will you
 have to hang out with me...

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:48.110
if you join a sporty 
club like the basketball one?

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:50.200
Like I said, I turned him down.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:51.580
You should join.

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:56.010
You can find all the sweat, 
hard work, and high fives...

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:57.800
absent from your youth at the Basketball Club.

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:01.750
Asaba Yuki on the basketball team...

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:03.390
Sweat and hard work...

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:04.760
...and high fives...

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:08.010
This shrimp is delicious.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:11.350
I can't do it. I can't even imagine it.

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.270
I think I did a little.

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:16.020
It was really blurry, though.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.280
That's amazing, Yuta-kun.

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:19.720
I couldn't see anything.

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:22.730
I know, pretty serious business, right? So...

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:24.340
No, no!

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:25.710
I <i>won't</i> let you join the club!

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:27.510
Why does he need <i>your</i> permission?

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:31.200
Thanks for the food.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:34.480
Why didn't they try to headhunt me, anyway?

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:36.020
I wonder why...

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:37.470
Hey, wait a sec.

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:39.180
Come here, you.

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:45.060
We'll go on ahead.

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:49.270
What is it?

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:50.680
You can have my stickers.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:54.880
I started collecting 
them for a second plate,

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:57.300
but I don't think I can 
get enough in time.

00:04:58.760 --> 00:04:59.690
There, got it.

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:02.460
That's all you got?

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:03.790
That's hardly worth it.

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:05.810
It's worth plenty.

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:08.570
For a poor student like you, 
this is a big payoff.

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:11.700
Here's your sticker.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:14.460
Did you see the new design?

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:17.250
The second plate's pretty cute, too.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.270
I'm so hungry.

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.070
Why don't you get that today?

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:23.290
What? You don't want it?

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:26.740
No, I do...

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:29.300
Kayo, we've got some
 more hungry students.

00:05:29.650 --> 00:05:31.010
Okay.

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:33.140
Well, anyway, these are yours.

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:50.070
I see. So she gave you her stickers.

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.290
Yeah.

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:52.650
That's the second time.

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:55.040
Yeah.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:03.920
Asaba.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.450
Have you given any thought to joining us?

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:09.740
Didn't I tell you I'm not interested?

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:12.050
You're no fun.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:13.810
Tada!

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:15.320
If you join our club,

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:18.060
maybe I'll give you these 
stickers. Or whatever.

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:20.850
Your invitation is turning 
into a business deal.

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:23.790
If all it takes are some measly stickers, 
it's no skin off my nose.

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:24.860
For you, maybe.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:28.220
I'm surprised you know Yuki 
is collecting stickers.

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:30.010
You can get this kind of info...

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:32.320
from the girls in a flash.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:33.870
For the second giveaway campaign,

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:38.820
if you collect 30 stickers you'll 
receive an Anpanda plate.

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:40.160
Don't you want some...

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.000
Hey!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.290
Wait!

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.920
Just come watch us play!

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:52.940
What's your problem?

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:56.040
Get away from my Yukki.

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:19.040
<b>Cafeteria/Store</b>

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:34.400
Oh, it's you.

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:36.040
Were you sleeping?

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:39.140
Just thinking.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:41.270
If you'd gotten here a little earlier,

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.550
you could've helped me 
wipe down the tables again.

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:46.200
Did you cut your finger again?

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:50.070
Not this time.

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:11.760
Oh.

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:15.420
Sorry, did you come 
here to buy something?

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:18.220
No.

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:22.880
Um, I came to get some stickers.

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:24.470
Stickers?

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:28.190
Don't start thinking other people will 
always be around to help you.

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:30.230
But you gave me some the other day.

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:32.120
That was then.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:35.030
You shouldn't rely on me 
for all your stickers.

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:36.910
I'm quitting this job soon.

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:38.120
What?

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:40.720
I'm quitting at the end of the week.

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:43.370
I'm going to work in a salon again.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.700
"Again"?

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:47.750
It might surprise you, but I used to 
work in a salon before ending up here.

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:50.760
I'm not bad at hair and makeup.

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:54.510
Why are you making that face?

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:55.630
No reason.

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:59.480
I'll have to start living on 
my own, so it'll be tough.

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:01.520
I'll have to pack and stuff.

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:07.200
The end of the week.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.570
You don't want to go?

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:10.540
No, that's not it.

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:14.120
I think it'd be just fine if you
 kept working in the cafeteria.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:17.860
It doesn't seem like a salon 
would be as much fun.

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:20.650
I told you, that's not it.

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:24.230
But you already quit once.

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:27.960
Do you really want to work 
there again that badly?

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:30.050
What? Are you calling me selfish?

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:32.060
No, that's not what I...

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:33.120
What, then?

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.470
Excuse me.

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:47.040
Is the shop closed for the day?

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:50.530
Oh, you're fine. Sorry, sorry.

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:11.140
You got a 74 in English.

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:11.840
Yes.

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:14.740
That's pretty good for you, Shun.

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:16.240
English isn't your strongest subject.

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:18.610
It's because everyone helped me study.

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:19.840
Chizuru, how did you do?

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:22.370
Dunno if I should show you.

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:25.980
My godly score might blind 
ordinary mortals like yourselves.

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:28.510
That bad?

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:30.280
Just show us.

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.150
Chizuru-kun.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:33.360
No, no! You'll laugh!

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:35.900
Those two never laugh.

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:41.320
I'm sorry we asked you to show us.

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:44.500
Well, they say "live fast, die young," don't they?

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:46.690
What? Am I that screwed?

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:51.130
Come on. I bet you're
 one to talk, Yukki...

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:55.130
Uh, 81? Isn't that higher than normal?

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:58.380
You studied harder than usual 
this time around. Right, Yuki?

00:10:58.380 --> 00:10:59.880
Traitor!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:01.850
Who cares, monkey?

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:03.660
I'm sure you made someone happy...

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:06.850
by dragging down the average.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:09.640
Even morons like you can 
do the world some good...

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:13.520
Monkey.

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:17.580
Well, you suck at teaching, Kanamecchi!

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:19.220
What did you say?!

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:22.410
You should wait until you evolve 
into a real human being before you say that!

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:26.740
It flew outside.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:28.960
Chizuru, you should have caught it.

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:31.500
There's no way I could catch 
such a painful truth!

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:34.800
Someone picked it up.

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:36.250
You're kidding.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:39.380
It's the girl from the cafeteria.

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:43.350
I can't let the Cafeteria 
Cinderella see that.

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:44.680
Let's go, Shun-chan.

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:46.930
What? Me, too?

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:54.400
Here, Tachibana Chizuru-kun.

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:58.240
Her impression of me is ruined.

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:00.030
Thank you.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:02.890
You should try a little harder.

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:04.650
Aren't you worried about your entrance exams?

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:06.300
Nah. In this day and age,

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:09.120
it's better to get work 
experience than attend college.

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:10.680
Just like you're doing.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:11.840
Like me?

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:14.110
Don't you have a catering license?

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:16.670
No, I don't have anything like that.

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:19.260
What? You don't?

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:23.540
After I graduated from high school, 
I studied hair and makeup.

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:27.220
No wonder your hair's so beautiful.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:27.960
Hey.

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:28.700
Ouch.

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:32.520
Don't touch a lady's hair 
without her permission, kid.

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:33.490
Hey.

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:35.920
We're leaving.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:37.230
Okay.

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:39.750
You guys are such good friends.

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:42.020
You eat lunch together and 
walk home together too.

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:45.730
One of you didn't come 
to the cafeteria today.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:48.880
Yeah, Yukki wanted to 
eat in the classroom.

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:50.720
I see.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:53.100
We'll all come to the cafeteria again.

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:53.850
Okay.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:55.960
Oh, I...

00:12:58.030 --> 00:13:00.000
Oh, well.

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:28.660
<b>Cafeteria/Store</b>

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:29.100
I'm hungry.

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.270
You can't fight on an empty stomach.

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:34.370
Fight what? Do you have to retake your test?

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:35.070
Hey.

00:13:35.070 --> 00:13:36.760
Yes?

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:38.410
I get the feeling one of you...

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:40.920
hasn't come to the cafeteria 
for a few days now.

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:44.670
Oh, Yuki's eating bread 
in the classroom again.

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:47.250
I see.

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:50.930
What do you mean, "I see"? 
Hurry up and get serving!

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:51.800
Ow!

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:55.480
Can't you at least work 
hard on your last day?

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:58.200
I always work hard.

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:01.600
Go say goodbye to the teachers 
before you leave.

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:02.880
Okay, okay.

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:06.480
I'm sorry you had to see that.

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:07.990
Not at all.

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:09.070
Um...

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:10.920
She's quitting?

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:12.130
Oh, Kayo?

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:14.950
Yes, today's her last day.

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:16.920
I see.

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:21.130
Don't worry. When she's gone, 
I'll still look after you boys.

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:22.300
Oh.

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:23.950
You too, miss.

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:26.470
Um, I'm not a girl.

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:30.720
Oh, my. Really? I'm so sorry.

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:32.620
Hey.

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:35.600
Um, I...

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:42.630
Four more points.

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:43.700
Yuki-kun.

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:47.110
Can I eat here, too?

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.640
Sure. Why aren't you 
eating in the cafeteria?

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:53.150
I feel like eating bread today.

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:54.620
I'm going to borrow a chair.

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:58.910
It's nice when it's just us 
two once in a while.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.920
You don't have to worry about me.

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:03.280
You could've eaten in the cafeteria.

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:08.000
If Kaname and Chizuru fight, 
who's going to stop them?

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:14.430
Yes, but I thought you might 
be lonely by yourself.

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:17.800
I'm fine.

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:19.050
But...

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:25.810
I got all sad thinking about
you eating by yourself.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:32.450
<i>My mom would be lonely 
eating by herself.</i>

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:36.540
<i>The end of the week.</i>

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:43.040
That doesn't bother me, 
so I wouldn't know.

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:45.660
Oh, I see.

00:15:45.660 --> 00:15:46.440
But...

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:51.010
People who don't like 
it must really hate it.

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:54.150
Yuki-kun?

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:58.930
You almost have all the stickers you need.

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:04.900
What? You're going to join us?

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:08.030
I didn't say that.

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:10.640
I just said I wanted your stickers.

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:12.370
Stickers, huh?

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:14.870
You really got my hopes up.

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:18.300
I didn't expect you to come talk to me.

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:22.540
Let's play a quick game.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:25.670
If you can get past my 
defense and get a basket,

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:26.960
I'll give you the stickers.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:30.130
But if you lose the ball 
to me or miss your shot,

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.930
you have to join the club.

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:35.020
I'm in a rush, so let's hurry this up.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.730
You're no fun.

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:43.860
Can't you just think for a second 
about joining the club?

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:47.190
Is collecting stickers even fun?

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:49.880
I'm sure basketball's more...

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:50.530
Huh?

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.620
I'm in a hurry. Can I have my stickers?

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:01.410
<b>Cafeteria/Store</b>

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:18.200
What are you doing?

00:17:18.570 --> 00:17:19.930
What are you doing?

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:22.930
I'm the one asking the questions here.

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:40.520
What's this?

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:41.740
You can have it.

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.960
This is the convenience store plate.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.080
You don't want it?

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:47.330
It's a gift.

00:17:48.340 --> 00:17:49.910
Because you're angry.

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:52.980
I'm not angry. I was just venting a little.

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:57.220
Can I even accept this gift?

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:01.970
Also...

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:05.290
I don't think it's bad for you...

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:08.570
to leave your mom and 
live on your own.

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:15.680
It's turning red!

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:19.970
You're a young guy. 
You can run faster than that.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:22.630
Come on!

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:41.000
My mom usually talks a lot.

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:44.630
The first time I moved out,

00:18:44.630 --> 00:18:46.740
she was quiet all the way to the station.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:51.360
She was quiet while we 
waited at crossings.

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:57.130
She'd speak a little, but, you know...

00:18:58.090 --> 00:19:01.000
I figured she was choosing 
her words carefully.

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:05.220
The more you get that feeling,

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:07.830
the worse it gets.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.560
When I quit the salon,

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:15.720
I thought my mom would scold me.

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:18.300
Tell me not to be such a baby.

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:21.840
But she told me to come home.

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:28.220
When things got tough, 
I ran back to my mom.

00:19:29.240 --> 00:19:33.360
But now I'm running out 
to chase after what I want,

00:19:34.450 --> 00:19:38.150
and leaving my mom on her own again.

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:41.110
I think...

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:42.960
your mother will probably...

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:45.300
just go home and watch 
TV like she always does.

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:49.110
You're the only one thinking 
about this so much.

00:19:49.970 --> 00:19:51.080
Really?

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:54.630
You're right.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:59.100
It's not a bad thing to have 
something you want to do.

00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:01.650
I don't really have anything.

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:04.060
What are you babbling about?

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:06.640
You have your whole life ahead of you.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:09.570
Lots of decisions and choices...

00:20:09.570 --> 00:20:11.960
Lots of beginnings and ends.

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:16.610
I'm jealous.

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:31.860
It's green.

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:33.600
I'm off this way.

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:35.170
Oh, are you?

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:37.190
Well, bye bye.

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:48.100
Please use that plate.

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:51.850
Even if it's only once in a while.

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:54.350
Sure, I will.

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:56.500
Thanks.

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:19.600
<i>Liar.</i>

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:23.690
What are you doing?

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:26.890
Just take what you need with you.

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:29.120
I know.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.890
You'll come back for New 
Year's and Bon, won't you?

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:34.610
Yeah.

00:21:34.610 --> 00:21:35.390
Unbelievable.

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:39.650
Don't go to work with 
hair like that, okay?

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:41.980
I know.

00:21:56.590 --> 00:21:58.290
That kid.

00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:05.620
Kaname, is Yuki in there?

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:06.680
Yuki?

00:22:07.930 --> 00:22:11.270
Isn't he drooling over 
some magazine like always?

00:22:12.460 --> 00:22:15.420
Man, something might've changed in his life...

00:22:15.420 --> 00:22:17.550
if he'd joined the Basketball Club.

00:22:18.640 --> 00:22:22.940
<i>May the colors that begin to bloom...</i>

00:22:23.680 --> 00:22:26.050
<i>on your path be beautiful.</i>

00:24:16.610 --> 00:24:19.390
The next episode is "Sweet Sweet Bitter."
